            "details": "That was my rock bottom. Sobbing at a Cheerios ad in front of my kids.\n42-day cycle. Then 22 days. Then 38. My mood was a roulette wheel.\nI was terrified of HRT. My mom had breast cancer.\nKunzite was my 'anything but hormones' purchase. 4 weeks in: hot flashes cut in half. Mood swings down to manageable. My cycle went 28, 30, 29.\nI'm not who I was at 25. But I'm me again.",
