            "details": "I'd been waking up drenched. Soaked sheets, 3am shower, can't get back to sleep.\nPut this on my wrist. Day 4 I woke up dry. I thought it was a fluke. Then day 5. Then 6.\nIt's been 5 weeks. I've had maybe 2 night sweats total.\nI don't know how a bracelet does this. I just know my sheets are dry and I sleep through.",
