            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"My family stopped walking on eggshells around me\"",
            "details": "The rage scared me. I'd snap over NOTHING. My husband flinched when I raised my voice. My 8-year-old started asking 'are you in a good mood today?' before talking to me.\nI tried DIM, evening primrose, vitex. Nothing touched the rage.\nKunzite didn't eliminate emotions. It regulated them. I feel things now instead of being ambushed by them.\nMy son stopped asking about my mood. That's the result that matters.",
