            "quote": "\"I went from 42-day cycles to 28. In one month.\"",
            "details": "My period was a mystery. Sometimes 3 weeks. Sometimes 6. I was buying pregnancy tests constantly.\nStarted wearing Kunzite daily. First cycle after: 32 days. Second: 29. Third: 28.\nI almost didn't believe it. But my tracking app doesn't lie.\nI feel like I can trust my own body for the first time in 2 years.",
